lmrs-container (0.1.7-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * local_lmcache_status reports real hit/miss token counters read from the
    runtime's external KV-connector metrics, plus the measured disk tier, and
    names any source that did not answer instead of reporting zeros.
  * The info command reports the live proxy registration state built from the
    adapter framework's registration snapshot; the framework's missing
    heartbeat timestamp is declared and tracked as an upstream bug.

